WEBVTT

NOTE
The Ragnarok — the red dragon-shaped Esthar spaceship in space.
Duration: approximately 40 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
A dark red angular ship resolves against the moon into the Ragnarok.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.900
Esthar's crimson, dragon-shaped spacecraft glides through the starfield.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.350
Its green eye-ports and red hull pass in sweeping detail.
